    LLM: "Bidding starts at 7 tricks. Players bid number of tricks (7-13) or pass. Highest bidder declares Trump (Tarneeb). Player to dealer's right (or bidder) leads first. Must follow suit. Highest trump wins, or highest card of led suit. Winner leads next.",
