      'Scoring example: If declaring team wins bid details: Score = Tricks taken. Bonus often applies for 13 (Kaboot). If they fail: Score = Negative of bid (or zero for opponents, or opponents score tricks taken + bonus). Non-bidding team scores tricks taken (unless bidder fails). Exact scoring varies by region (e.g. Tarneeb 41 rules). Win at least as many tricks as bid. First team to reach target score (e.g., 31, 41, or 61) wins..',
